Output media/live.gif
Output media/live.mp4

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "Iosevka Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1120
Set Height 680
Set Padding 22
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && clear && python3 media/live/session.py"
Enter
Sleep 9s
Show
Sleep 600ms
Type "Back up the datasets, build, and run the tests"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 30s
